ass at inventing detail, and its Mystic model, Relight tools and model training give real control over texture, lighting and consistency. Beyond that it now runs a live node canvas with multiplayer, an agent that wires and runs nodes, a timeline video editor and a huge stock library. It is a capable, well-funded platform, not a one-trick upscaler, and worth taking seriously."]}],"$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e"]}]]}]]}],"$L1f"]
