15:["$","ul","b1080-parent",{"children":[["$","li","b1080",{"children":[["$","strong","b1078",{"children":["The agent and MCP stop at generation. "]}],"Its MCP and integrations are described as generating assets rather than building or running the canvas remotely, and there's no native Slack workflow, so an external agent can make images but can't operate the canvas end to end for you."]}],["$","li","b1083",{"children":[["$","strong","b1081",{"children":["Deterministic flows, not team skills. "]}],"Customization runs through preset flows rather than natural-language, team-defined slash-command skills, so teaching the agent your brand voice as reusable commands isn't really the model."]}],["$","li","b1086",{"children":[["$","strong","b1084",{"children":["Detail that drifts. "]}],"The same hallucination that makes the upscaler impressive can \"overcook\" an image, inventing detail that diverges from the original, especially on photorealistic portraits."]}],["$","li","b1089",{"children":[["$","strong","b1087",{"children":["Premium pricing, no free trial. "]}],"Users report no free tier to test with and a strict no-refund policy, so evaluating it means paying up front, and heavy trial-and-error burns credits."]}]]}]
