18:["$","ul","b1096-parent",{"children":[["$","li","b1096",{"children":[["$","strong","b1094",{"children":["An agent that reaches past the canvas. "]}],"Mel plans and runs multi-step work on the canvas and also inside Slack, so a request, an approval and a finished download can happen in the thread where briefs actually arrive, not only in the app."]}],["$","li","b1099",{"children":[["$","strong","b1097",{"children":["A canvas-level MCP. "]}],"An external agent like Claude can build and run the Melius canvas itself, creating nodes, wiring them and executing, rather than only calling a generation endpoint. That's the difference between an agent that operates your workspace and one that just returns assets."]}],["$","li","b1102",{"children":[["$","strong","b1100",{"children":["Teach it your brand, run many at once. "]}],"Give the agent brand instructions plus reference images and save custom slash-command skills, then run several agents concurrently with visible presence on the canvas, personalization and a workforce, not a single assistant."]}],["$","li","b1111",{"children":[["$","strong","b1103",{"children":["Resize and enhance in-line, one subscription. "]}],"Magic resize, image enhancement and ",["$","$L2b","b1106",{"link":{"_type":"link","_key":"b1105","href":"/blog/best-ai-photo-background-editing-tools","isNewTab":false},"children":["background removal"]}]," live as nodes, so an upscale flows straight into the next step, and every image, video and audio model shares ",["$","$L2b","b1109",{"link":{"_type":"link","_key":"b1108","href":"/blog/one-subscription-every-model","isNewTab":false},"children":["one subscription"]}]," with up to 8 seats on self-serve plans, unlimited seats on Enterprise, and unlimited agent usage."]}],["$","li","b1114",{"children":[["$","strong","b1112",{"children":["Your own work, semantically searchable. "]}],"Past Magnific's stock library, every image you generate or upload is auto-indexed by content, so you find your own past work by describing it rather than remembering a filename or re-upscaling from scratch."]}]]}]
19:["$","div","b1115",{"role":"region","aria-label":"Comparison table, scroll horizontally to see all columns","tabIndex":0,"data-lenis-prevent":true,"className":"my-10 max-w-full overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-black/10 bg-white shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-orange","children":["$","table",null,{"className":"w-full min-w-[640px] border-collapse text-left","children":["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","b1116",{"className":"bg-black/[0.04]","children":[["$","td","b11160",{"className":"t-b-3 min-w-48 align-top [&_p]:m-0 text-gray-dark-1 px-4 py-3 font-medium","children":[["$","p","b1119",{"children":[["$","strong","b1118",{"children":[""]}]]}]]}],["$","td","b11161",{"className":"t-b-3 min-w-48 align-top [&_p]:m-0 text-gray-dark-1 px-4 py-3 font-medium","children":[["$","p","b1122",{"children":[["$","strong","b1121",{"children":["Melius"]}]]}]]}],["$","td","b11162",{"className":"t-b-3 min-w-48 align-top [&_p]:m-0 text-gray-dark-1 px-4 py-3 font-medium","children":[["$","p","b1125",{"children":[["$","strong","b1124",{"children":["Magnific"]}]]}]]}]]}],["$","tr","b1126",{"className":"border-t border-black/10","children":[["$","td","b11260",{"className":"t-b-3 min-w-48 align-top [&_p]:m-0 text-foreground px-4 py-3.5","children":[["$","p","b1129",{"children":["Core focus"]}]]}],["$","td","b11261",{"className":"t-b-3 min-w-48 align-top [&_p]:m-0 text-foreground px-4 py-3.5","children":[["$","p","b1132",{"children":["Agent-run creative workspace"]}]]}],["$","td","b11262",{"className":"t-b-3 min-w-48 align-top [&_p]:m-0 text-foreground px-4 py-3.5","children":[["$","p","b1135",{"children":["Upscaling heritage, now a full suite"]}]]}]]}],["$","tr","b1136",{"className":"border-t border-black/10","children":[["$","td","b11360",{"className":"t-b-3 min-w-48 align-top [&_p]:m-0 text-foreground px-4 py-3.5","children":[["$","p","b1139",{"children":["Node canvas + in-canvas agent"]}]]}],["$","td","b11361",{"className":"t-b-3 min-w-48 align-top [&_p]:m-0 text-foreground px-4 py-3.5","children":[["$","p","b1142",{"children":["Yes"]}]]}],["$","td","b11362",{"className":"t-b-3 min-w-48 align-top [&_p]:m-0 text-foreground px-4 py-3.5","children":[["$","p","b1145",{"children":["Yes"]}]]}]]}],["$","tr","b1146",{"className":"border-t border-black/10","children":[["$","td","b11460",{"className":"t-b-3 min-w-48 align-top [&_p]:m-0 text-foreground px-4 py-3.5","children":[["$","p","b1149",{"children":["Agent in Slack"]}]]}],["$","td","b11461",{"className":"t-b-3 min-w-48 align-top [&_p]:m-0 text-foreground px-4 py-3.5","children":[["$","p","b1152",{"children":["Full workflow in a thread"]}]]}],["$","td","b11462",{"className":"t-b-3 min-w-48 align-top [&_p]:m-0 text-foreground px-4 py-3.5","children":[["$","p","b1155",{"children":["Not native"]}]]}]]}],["$","tr","b1156",{"className":"border-t border-black/10","children":[["$","td","b11560",{"className":"t-b-3 min-w-48 align-top [&_p]:m-0 text-foreground px-4 py-3.5","children":[["$","p","b1159",{"children":["Canvas-level MCP"]}]]}],["$","td","b11561",{"className":"t-b-3 min-w-48 align-top [&_p]:m-0 text-foreground px-4 py-3.5","children":[["$","p","b1162",{"children":["Builds & runs the canvas"]}]]}],["$","td","b11562",{"className":"t-b-3 min-w-48 align-top [&_p]:m-0 text-foreground px-4 py-3.5","children":[["$","p","b1165",{"children":["Generation-only"]}]]}]]}]]}]}]}]
