1e:["$","div","b1177",{"className":"faq-list my-10 flex flex-col divide-y divide-black/10 border-y border-black/10","children":[["$","details","0",{"className":"faq-item","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-gray-dark-1 flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 font-medium select-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":["What is the best Magnific alternative?",["$","svg",null,{"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","aria-hidden":"true","className":"text-foreground-muted size-5 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 [[open]_&]:rotate-180","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M6 9l6 6 6-6","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round"}]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-foreground-muted m-0 pr-8 pb-5","children":"Melius is the strongest alternative for teams. Magnific is a capable, well-funded platform, a real node canvas with an in-canvas agent, a timeline editor and model training on top of its best-in-class upscaler, so this isn't a canvas-versus-no-canvas comparison. The wedge is agent reach: on Melius the agent also runs inside Slack, the MCP is canvas-level so an external agent can build and run the canvas itself, teams teach it their brand as reusable slash-command skills, and self-serve plans include up to 8 seats, Enterprise includes unlimited seats, and agent usage is unlimited."}]]}],["$","details","1",{"className":"faq-item","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-gray-dark-1 flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 font-medium select-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":["Does Melius upscale and resize images like Magnific?",["$","svg",null,{"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","aria-hidden":"true","className":"text-foreground-muted size-5 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 [[open]_&]:rotate-180","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M6 9l6 6 6-6","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round"}]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-foreground-muted m-0 pr-8 pb-5","children":"Yes. Melius includes magic resize and image enhancement as steps on the canvas, alongside background removal and other edits. The difference is that these live inside an end-to-end workflow: generate, edit, resize and hand off, rather than a standalone upscaler you round-trip through."}]]}],["$","details","2",{"className":"faq-item","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-gray-dark-1 flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 font-medium select-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":["Why do people look for a Magnific alternative?",["$","svg",null,{"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","aria-hidden":"true","className":"text-foreground-muted size-5 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 [[open]_&]:rotate-180","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M6 9l6 6 6-6","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round"}]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-foreground-muted m-0 pr-8 pb-5","children":"Commonly cited reasons: it is priced at the premium end with no free trial and a strict no-refund policy, its creative upscaling can \"overcook\" images and invent detail that drifts from the original, and heavy trial-and-error burns credits. Its agent and MCP are also generation-focused rather than driving the canvas remotely, and there is no native Slack workflow, so teams that want an agent reaching across their whole stack look elsewhere."}]]}],["$","details","3",{"className":"faq-item","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-gray-dark-1 flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 font-medium select-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":["How does Magnific AI work?","$L2c"]}],"$L2d"]}],"$L2e","$L2f"]}]
1f:["$","section","related",{"className":"relative w-full pb-section bg-gray-background","children":[["$","$L11",null,{"color":"gray"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"relative z-10 mx-auto w-full max-w-300 px-5 lg:px-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"t-h-2 mb-12 text-center text-balance text-gray-dark-1","children":"Related Articles"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto grid w-full max-w-max grid-cols-1 gap-11 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3","children":[["$","$L30","post-figma-weave-alternative",{"post":{"_key":"post-figma-weave-alternative","slug":"figma-weave-alternative","category":"comparisons","title":"The best Figma Weave alternative for generative design","isoDate":"2026-07-21","date":"July 21, 2026","readTime":"6 Min Read","excerpt":"Looking for a Figma Weave (Weavy) alternative? Weave puts a generation canvas next to your design files, great if you live in Figma. If you don't, the ecosystem coupling and fast credit burn become constraints. Here's how Melius compares as a standalone, canvas-first workspace with an agent and one credit pool.","image":{"url":"/images/blog/figma-weave-alternative/cover.webp"},"authors":[{"name":"Alex Chen, Member of Technical Staff"}],"faq":[{"question":"What is the best Figma Weave alternative?","answer":"Melius is the strongest standalone alternative to Figma Weave. Both are node-based generation canvases with broad model access, but Melius is an independent creative workspace rather than a layer tied to the Figma ecosystem, it adds Mel to plan and wire multi-step work, and it keeps every model under one credit pool."},{"question":"How is Melius different from Figma Weave?","answer":"The biggest difference is the agent. Figma Weave has no AI agent, so its node graphs are wired and run by hand, and it is deeply tied to Figma's ecosystem. Melius is a standalone, agent-first workspace: Mel builds and runs the graph from a brief and also works in Slack, its MCP is canvas-level so an external agent like Claude can drive the canvas from any host, and every model shares one subscription."},{"question":"Is Figma Weave the same as Weavy?","answer":"Yes. Weavy was the original node-based generation canvas; Figma acquired it and rebranded it Figma Weave, folding it into Figma Design. So a Weavy alternative and a Figma Weave alternative are the same search. If you want that node-canvas-plus-generation model but without the Figma coupling, Melius is a standalone equivalent with an agent and one shared credit pool."},{"question":"Why do people look for a Figma Weave alternative?","answer":"The dominant complaint is credit cost: users report credits burning extremely fast, sometimes thousands of credits for a few minutes of work, with iterative fixes for AI mistakes eating more. There are also reports of billing friction on cancellation, and some tooling is still in open beta. Teams outside the Figma ecosystem also want a standalone option."},{"question":"Does Melius integrate with design tools?","answer":"Melius exposes an MCP server, so an agent like Claude can read and act on your canvas from your own environment. Rather than binding generation to one design suite, it aims to be model-agnostic and host-agnostic so it fits whatever workflow you already use."},{"question":"Can Melius sequence video like Weave's Timeline?","answer":"Yes. Melius includes an in-app multi-track editor for arranging shots, timing and layering audio, alongside the node canvas for building the generations that feed it."}],"tableOfContents":[{"_key":"what-figma-weave-does-well","title":"What Weave does well"},{"_key":"where-teams-hit-friction","title":"The friction"},{"_key":"how-melius-approaches-the-same-work","title":"The Melius approach"},{"_key":"who-should-switch","title":"Who should switch"},{"_key":"frequently-asked-questions","title":"FAQ"}],"content":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1179","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1178","text":"Figma Weave, the product that started as Weavy before Figma acquired it, is a strong idea: a node-based generation canvas with real editing tools, compositing, masking, color grading, and a Timeline for sequencing, plus a set of one-click workflows surfaced right inside Figma Design. For designers who already live in Figma, having generation that close to their work is compelling.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1183","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1180","text":"That tight coupling is also the reason people search for a ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1181","text":"Figma Weave alternative","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1182","text":". If you don't live in Figma, or you want a standalone workspace with an agent and more predictable costs, the ecosystem fit becomes a constraint rather than a feature. Here's how Melius compares.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1185","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1184","text":"What Figma Weave does well","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"what-figma-weave-does-well"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1187","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1186","text":"Weave combines generation with genuine editing, compositing, masking and grading, not just prompt-in, image-out, and its node graph makes each step visible and re-runnable. The June 2026 Timeline brought video sequencing and sound onto the same canvas, and the embedded workflows make common design tasks a click away for anyone already in Figma. As a design-adjacent generation layer, it's well built.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1189","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1188","text":"Where teams hit friction","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"where-teams-hit-friction"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1192","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1190","text":"No agent, fully manual. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1191","text":"This is the biggest gap. Where the rest of the field has some kind of AI agent, Weave's node graphs are wired and run by hand, so someone has to build every pipeline. There's also no announced Slack, MCP, API or CLI to drive it from elsewhere.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1195","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1193","text":"Credits burn fast. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1194","text":"A dominant complaint: users report thousands of credits consumed for a few minutes of work, with iterative fixes for AI mistakes, effectively paying to troubleshoot the tool, eating still more.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1198","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1196","text":"Ecosystem lock-in. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1197","text":"Weave's value is tightly coupled to Figma's world, and there's no audio or voice. If your team isn't Figma-first, much of the advantage doesn't apply.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1201","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1199","text":"Mid-acquisition uncertainty. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1200","text":"Some embedded tooling and the full Figma-to-Weave sync are still rolling out through beta, so the roadmap is moving while Figma folds it in.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1203","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1202","text":"How Melius approaches the same work","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"how-melius-approaches-the-same-work"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1205","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1204","text":"Melius is a standalone, agent-first workspace, so the thing Weave leaves to you, building and running the graph, is exactly what the agent does.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1208","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1206","text":"An agent instead of manual wiring. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1207","text":"Mel reads your brief, picks a model per step, wires the node graph, runs it, and writes each per-model prompt, so multi-step work starts from intent, not hand assembly. It also runs in Slack and can carry your brand context and skills into every generation.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1211","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1209","text":"Drivable from your own tools. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1210","text":"A canvas-level MCP means an external agent like Claude can build and run the Melius canvas from your own environment, rather than binding your generations to a single design suite. Several agents can also work one canvas at once with visible presence.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1217","style":"normal","markDefs":[{"_type":"link","_key":"b1214","href":"/blog/one-subscription-every-model","isNewTab":false}],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1212","text":"Generation, audio and assembly in one place. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1213","text":"Image, video and audio models (including voice and music) live on the same canvas, with an in-app multi-track editor to sequence and export, all under ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1215","text":"a single subscription","marks":["b1214"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1216","text":" with up to 8 seats on self-serve plans, unlimited seats on Enterprise, and unlimited agent usage.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1220","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1218","text":"Real-time multiplayer for the team. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1219","text":"A whole team works the same canvas live, without depending on one design ecosystem's rollout schedule.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1223","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1221","text":"Assets you can actually find. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1222","text":"Every generation and upload lands in a semantic asset library you search by what's in the image, not a flat pile of files to scroll through later.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"portableTable","_key":"b1224","rows":[{"_key":"b1225","cells":[{"_key":"b1226","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1228","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1227","text":"","marks":["strong"]}]}]},{"_key":"b1229","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1231","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1230","text":"Melius","marks":["strong"]}]}]},{"_key":"b1232","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1234","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1233","text":"Figma Weave","marks":["strong"]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b1235","cells":[{"_key":"b1236","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1238","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1237","text":"Node-based canvas","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1239","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1241","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1240","text":"Yes","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1242","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1244","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1243","text":"Yes","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b1245","cells":[{"_key":"b1246","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1248","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1247","text":"AI agent","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1249","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1251","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1250","text":"Operates the canvas + Slack","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1252","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1254","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1253","text":"None, fully manual","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b1255","cells":[{"_key":"b1256","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1258","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1257","text":"Standalone or tied","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1259","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1261","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1260","text":"Standalone workspace","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1262","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1264","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1263","text":"Coupled to Figma ecosystem","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b1265","cells":[{"_key":"b1266","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1268","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1267","text":"Drive from other tools","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1269","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1271","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1270","text":"Canvas-level MCP, any host","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1272","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1274","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1273","text":"None announced","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b1275","cells":[{"_key":"b1276","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1278","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1277","text":"Audio / voice","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1279","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1281","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1280","text":"Voice, music & speech-to-text","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1282","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1284","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1283","text":"None","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b1285","cells":[{"_key":"b1286","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1288","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1287","text":"Pixel editing depth","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1289","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1291","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1290","text":"Growing","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1292","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1294","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1293","text":"Deepest in class (a real strength)","marks":[]}]}]}]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1296","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1295","text":"Who should switch","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"who-should-switch"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1298","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1297","text":"If your team is Figma-first and mostly wants the deepest pixel editing next to your design files, Weave's editing and integration are a real advantage. If you want an agent that builds and runs the pipeline for you rather than wiring every node by hand, drivable from your own AI tools, with audio and one subscription across every model, Melius is the more independent, agent-first home for that work.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1303","style":"normal","markDefs":[{"_type":"link","_key":"b1300","href":"https://app.melius.com","isNewTab":true}],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1299","text":"Work on a canvas that isn't locked to one tool. ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1301","text":"Open Melius","marks":["b1300"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1302","text":".","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1305","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1304","text":"Frequently asked questions","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"frequently-asked-questions"},{"_type":"faqList","_key":"b1306","items":"$1f:props:children:1:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:post:faq"}]}}],"$L31","$L32"]}]]}]]}]
22:null
